   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "...Very well. I'll leave it to you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Captain to all units.@Destroy the five unknowns as close to@simultaneously as possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "However, the unknowns may split again.@Carry out your orders with that in mind.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "Simultaneously... Why do that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "I think it's to find the pattern@in how they multiply and merge...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "So if we take them all out at once,@they won't multiply anymore?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Tsugumi",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "There's no guarantee. If we destroy those unknowns,@they might split into smaller ones again.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Point is, we just gotta wipe 'em all out fast, right?@Suits me better anyway.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Eleve 1 to all units! Work together and destroy@the unknowns as simultaneously as you can!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Unknown Alpha, down!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
