   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Just as I thought.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Just as the Captain predicted.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Raji",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "However, they don't seem to fully return@to their pre-merge state.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Yeah. What was about a six-body merge@is down to three.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "So we're definitely doing damage.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "If we press the attack, we might be able@to wipe out the large unknowns.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "What runs out first, I wonder... our ammo, or them...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "If you're planning to gamble on it, don't. Against@foes that may be bottomless, the odds are bad.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Bring it on.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "All units, time your kills on the smaller split-off@unknowns as best you can too! Understood?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Unknown cluster destroyed, remaining enemies wiped@out! No enemies in the vicinity!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Captain, do you sense anything@like lingering thoughts?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "No... It's like murky water turning clear...@\"Purified\" might be the better word.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Purified, huh... Well put.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Any signs of the unknowns@reappearing from underground?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "None confirmed at present.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Captain, does that mean the sweep succeeded?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "We don't know yet. Commander, I'm concerned@about the other districts, but we should stay@here for a while.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "That's fine for this ship, but send the Hiryu@Custom back to Izu Base and finish servicing@its spatial transfer device as fast as possible.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Depending on the situation,@we may end up going to Paris.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Just 'cause you combined, don't think@you can take us!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Hatred has congealed in there...@We can't let ourselves get pulled in.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Multiplying and merging... They're getting more@active. There must be something besides@negative emotion behind it...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "They may be masses of negative emotion, but@they're not the Ruina. We wiped those out...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "(I feel like I've felt this before...@But I can't even tell what's mixed in@besides human emotion...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "(I can't believe this happened naturally.@Did someone engineer this...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "(Those unknowns...@It's like they're haunting this city...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "(Multiplying and merging over and over...@And what happens to them after that?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "(Why would the Cytron System react to something@so bizarre... something like a ghost?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "(This is getting occult.@The situation, and those kids too.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "Even against monsters like that, I'll fight!@I may be small fry, but I'm one of the Steel Dragons!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "Can the Soul Saber really@beat something like that...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Pull yourself together!@We may be small fry, but we're Steel Dragons too!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Earth Federation Army Far East Command, Izu Base",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "Izu Base - Command Center",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Sakae",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Commander, a report from the Hagane. As in Shinjuku,@they've wiped out the unknowns in Yokohama.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Laker",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "So the situation in Kanto is settled for now.@What about Osaka?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "It's back and forth. Even when <AM> units clear out@the unknowns, they reappear after a while.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Have unknowns been confirmed outside the cities...@in the suburbs, the mountains, at sea?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "No. Is there something in central Osaka@that prompts them to reappear?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Or else the <Steel Dragons> have the power@to annihilate the unknowns...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "I see...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "What's the situation in Paris and elsewhere?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "The same as Osaka.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Then sooner or later, the Joint Chiefs@may order us to show them@further proof.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Then shall we send the Steel Dragons to Osaka?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Before that, we need to bolster their forces.@I'm counting on you to hold things here for a while.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Waters near Japan",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Kurogane Bridge",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "...I see, so that's why the Kurogane came to Japan.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Unfortunately, Alchemie's concerns@proved correct.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "That brings me to a request. Right now, the Red@Ogre... the Person-Lichkeit is operating alongside@the Hagane's mobile units, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "I'd like you to lend us as much@of your other strength as you can.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "...As at the end of <The Sealing War>, you'd@gather special forces in the Steel Dragons to@wipe out the unknowns swiftly, and at the same time...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "...look into why they're able to do it.@Something along those lines?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Sharp as always. That's exactly it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Then along with Axel and Alchemie, I'll have@Yuuki Jegunan, Ricarla \"Carla\" Borgnine and@Touma Kanou join the Steel Dragons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "And you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "I'll take the Kurogane to the <Tesla Reich Institute>,@retrieve the units there, and rejoin you after.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Hagane - Briefing Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "So you want everyone on this list formally@assigned to the unit...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "That's right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "The <Special Tactics Instructor Unit> members, Ibis and@her team, Kota, Shoko, Lieutenant Calvina, and@<L&E Corporation>, hired as a job, are one thing...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "But what about Cliana Rimskaya@and Glacies?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Yes. Josh won't want those two taking part.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Re-Tech mobile weapons are a major asset.@Please talk him into it somehow.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "...Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "Izu Base - Interior",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Shoko, got a sec?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "What?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "We're headin' to Osaka next, right?@Michiru's over there visiting home.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Yeah... I hope she's okay.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Like she'd go down that easy. She's probably@fightin' those ghosts bare-handed right now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Even Michiru wouldn't...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Jokes aside... I want you to take the@G-Thundergate back to Asakusa@and bring the G-Bankaran.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "This mess looks like it's gonna drag on,@so I figure that guy oughta pitch in too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Got it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Say hi to Gramps for me. We'll meet up in Osaka.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Okay. I'm off, then.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "Izu Base - Mess Hall",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "...So, we'll be in the Steel Dragons' care again.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "We're counting on you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "Likewise.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "Alchemie and Axel are@officially joining too, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "That's right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Touma, what about my unit?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "I brought the Soulgain and the Ashsaviour.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "Minaki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "Maintenance on both is finished.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "Oh, right. I've got a message@for Kusuha and Bullet from Rätsel.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "For the two of us... could it be@about the RyuKoOh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "Yeah. He's taking the Kurogane to the@Tesla Institute to retrieve it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "Really?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "That's very good news.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "And he said he's bringing the Grungust Type 0,@the Type-2 and a new model too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "A new model... You mean Dr. Radom's?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "Yeah, the Gespenst Haken.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "They're really gathering up forces, aren't they?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "If only Major Sänger were here too...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "Right... Still no word from the Boss?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "Yes...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "He may have gone through the same thing as me,@Alchemie and Kota... but there's no way@to confirm it now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "(Boss... I wonder where you are now,@and what you're doing.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "You're saying Rim and Raki have to fight too?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "...Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "Then what about the investigation into the@<Fabula Foresse> explosion?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "If we examined the wreckage, we might find clues@about the people after Granteed...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "That investigation is, quite literally, frozen...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "The higher-ups decided the Steel Dragons@need the Dea Blanche Neige, the Forte Gigas@and the Fabularis.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "(Major Kai doesn't know the real reason.@Only Major Gilliam or Captain Viletta would...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "Are you against it, big bro?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "Of course. I'm the only one who needs to fight.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "I didn't go into battle before because I lacked@the power. If I can just get the Fabularis back,@I'll fight at your side, Josh.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "No. You have other choices.@You said you wanted to live a different life.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "But the situation won't allow that, will it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "This has nothing to do with you anymore.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "...Do you not need me, Josh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "That's not what I mean.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "(The real reason I'm against it is...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "If it's about the <Sympathia>,@the risk is the same for you, big bro.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "...Please understand, both of you. Whatever@happens from now on, it's enough that I fight.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "The whole world might be in trouble.@I can't just sit back and watch.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "I told you before. If something@happens to you, what about Chris?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "But there are people out there who wiped out@<Fabula Foresse> in an instant.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 407,
   "en": "That's...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 408,
   "en": "Like in <The Sealing War>, the whole world@might end up in trouble again. Then we all@have to work together to stop it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 409,
   "en": "Even if I'm the only one who survives, if something@happens to you guys, Chris will be sad too...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 410,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 411,
   "en": "Josh,@you said you had to see for yourself@what the Cross Gate would bring.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 412,
   "en": "And that you wanted us to come with you.@Isn't now that time?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 413,
   "en": "That was about the investigation...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 414,
   "en": "Hey, big bro... As long as the Cross Gate exists,@<That Incident> Dad set off@still isn't over.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 415,
   "en": "...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 416,
   "en": "You knew that too, which is why you wanted to@join the Cross Gate investigation team, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 417,
   "en": "You wanted to truly put an end to it, didn't you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 418,
   "en": "(That's right, I wanted to... the Cross Gate...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 419,
   "en": "Let me help you with that too,@if you need me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 420,
   "en": "...On one condition.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 421,
   "en": "If Cliff says not to get in a machine, you listen.@Not to me, to Cliff's judgment. Got it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 422,
   "en": "...Okay.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 423,
   "en": "Got it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 424,
   "en": "Then, Josh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 425,
   "en": "Yes. Please unseal their machines.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}